[
  {"id": 0, "src_sha256": "cf2c3abe7c367c8f60fe4cc5d83e0d5badd42fddb62ee099c8515a9d3b76e4e2", "zh": "砍他們、剁他們，沒必要對他們客氣。這就是我的座右銘。 "},
  {"id": 1, "src_sha256": "a96978839578eedcc5d24e0a6787af4a4bce706a4e82830b60b7930fa2b7ad07", "zh": "太好了。強者越來越強！ "},
  {"id": 2, "src_sha256": "013f25d4b6050f0d0fc6474416299d0121cb5c1ca260e6490f211c003965eca1", "zh": "喂！這血自己可不會停！ "},
  {"id": 3, "src_sha256": "e9912048399c6be72c771b1f65b6823f532cdea1f82b8311861f5373588b2613", "zh": "我快死了！我是認真的！ "},
  {"id": 4, "src_sha256": "83055fadff9c0ba194894df36df5639213f6aab3db1edf6b31e202b257ad1a94", "zh": "難道要我臉朝下倒在地上才能休息嗎？ "},
  {"id": 5, "src_sha256": "74bf6e5dbac1cf9070d667538127b584a59bb3b03f730a5683da8220c5ba96ad", "zh": "我有點不對勁。 "},
  {"id": 6, "src_sha256": "d99055fc190bd274763ae329106c5d58524078d6e94e620deeff6f510b65202a", "zh": "你沒看到我在受苦嗎？ "},
  {"id": 7, "src_sha256": "8158bf4a116eda4e22c09523847f23f44bea6e140221992bf9dc577387037956", "zh": "搞什麼……！我看不見了！ "},
  {"id": 8, "src_sha256": "5ea897e21cf262edee1ce06b18ed43bc53da082e903475c8189c4998b187f340", "zh": "太多了，會拖慢我的。 "},
  {"id": 9, "src_sha256": "708fdba833eb8106881ddc7367ce98e8352a7eae374baa76c51a43c143300ddb", "zh": "我完全動不了！ "},
  {"id": 10, "src_sha256": "b94022c2d402c60f183d270885ed6696b233adc0d4dbaea1e1d285a607f9d126", "zh": "我懂你意思！ "},
  {"id": 11, "src_sha256": "00cbc211753d788f7aa6f2f60589f6cb883a00b6d89563b664d8487e9b8845b1", "zh": "這種事我再也不想碰第二次。懂了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 12, "src_sha256": "901ad8d45336a4ddb637567359d981300c7f2e16a56d52dcf6edb9dd4e1c8884", "zh": "下次在我死之前先幫我。懂了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 13, "src_sha256": "94d6480cc0be0ca55666889de35aa954eb28356e665c2319676b43d254fbd711", "zh": "這下之後會很難搞。我就是知道。 "},
  {"id": 14, "src_sha256": "270fc07264f5390c6deefc4ec45101e2e7cf2b6267e64e62e6ffd7ebb4af7002", "zh": "來吧，早點把這事搞定。 "},
  {"id": 15, "src_sha256": "1993f2e02a2edbf75de255ff2d665ef7f078e9b56b608e580de62a46a345f591", "zh": "我寧可殺怪物也不想殺時間。懂我意思吧？ "},
  {"id": 16, "src_sha256": "b6010c6156b9aa140327e6ed7cc88d7ca52d74d3fd23f6654222919e15072177", "zh": "抱歉啦，老兄。沒有惡意。 "},
  {"id": 17, "src_sha256": "3200f0947e7d72c05692bad4fd97cfb119d9697e9213fc13fd0691030cc39784", "zh": "喂，你該攻擊的是另一邊那些傢伙。 "},
  {"id": 18, "src_sha256": "daa232fe4f8545ff9d8c7c1050179211b3ce7d56d9e5792565bead85f2396d7e", "zh": "可惡。有人要為他的死付出慘痛代價。 "},
  {"id": 19, "src_sha256": "746552b9c554b2639cd66cede520f2cfd4b39b84795fe3e1c1a6c5be0f58f82f", "zh": "可惡。她就像我的姊妹。 "},
  {"id": 20, "src_sha256": "1a284a5a2ac95a6ea542b4d60140994d7fe006d1d63a23798fe714080cf94747", "zh": "又倒下一個。 "},
  {"id": 21, "src_sha256": "52dd56a332dd63bd009e8af4330ba9de472ea0a813b6cbeeee70365ef8aa9c58", "zh": "我們乾脆自己放火燒了算了？那樣還比較快。 "},
  {"id": 22, "src_sha256": "871450cc083d6f2ece0d7d8b0a008f905a78ed7579b9694a1ea5cb25997dbede", "zh": "現在只剩我一個了，是吧？好吧，不過就算我倒下，也要拖一堆這種東西陪葬！ "},
  {"id": 23, "src_sha256": "df923b27fe590c95f2d70c47c4e900b537ce849c294e0b7192c6ea4670769fba", "zh": "有東西！去撿起來。 "},
  {"id": 24, "src_sha256": "a0d3866443dbf90dbae4636c4950bf0b1b3b4be1fc450ba83669aef01e84b2f7", "zh": "發現東西了！ "},
  {"id": 25, "src_sha256": "738119165c64d30b2049857e582b4b73c6a5e6dd94df652134c4211056dc01e6", "zh": "好，來拆掉這個小小的死亡陷阱。 "},
  {"id": 26, "src_sha256": "f358507ceecd8dac0f3c6edad241df6f6444e55173d24788874fdf313a732b9d", "zh": "有人想在這裡藏東西！ "},
  {"id": 27, "src_sha256": "f55f06e19def0ef878922d5d2b9b796961769ead2cce691aa6020c3270ad460c", "zh": "空氣裡有危險的味道。我喜歡！ "},
  {"id": 28, "src_sha256": "ef9cd2fb546a35f9067bfddc716c064765411e0e7b21d57d6dfdcb1457bc4b37", "zh": "我在掉血啊。 "},
  {"id": 29, "src_sha256": "04f2841ff5ec4af04135ef31d8d85c674ee21b1bae8f41560cd7e756f3fc2fc9", "zh": "哈，這跟打靶沒兩樣！ "},
  {"id": 30, "src_sha256": "dcdbd4d2c7adf9b2c07cee19e41d69baa41151031862b4bce374461df078bceb", "zh": "讓我上！ "},
  {"id": 31, "src_sha256": "1db22b08e5aa90aaf0988e0cc4cd874275cc9dd5ce550c884b33b3775ed6076a", "zh": "啊，這下有挑戰性了！ "},
  {"id": 32, "src_sha256": "b2f9f7f14d2de5c6dfa52edf5f00f1f9b14b7c29b2c6daaf665dfad4332003d1", "zh": "該殺誰？ "},
  {"id": 33, "src_sha256": "5105f64ea96315ca183600cf34d4476cba4e80ee7daa0ff5cf672b7a83a5d040", "zh": "越多越好。 "},
  {"id": 34, "src_sha256": "e4b188c3bf6e0f1a8c297e6c4b8ed6c56d6d58ac42dc85cb099b2fc3e1baf326", "zh": "好險！ "},
  {"id": 35, "src_sha256": "24ef80e5a03d45d90cf1c4a03287f6c0eaafc562913fa0be97ea4df93e715fc9", "zh": "這才好玩！ "},
  {"id": 36, "src_sha256": "d126d7b73501cb9abbe2ffdc285ad47630d97259ef3c4b50322ade339654e75f", "zh": "哈哈哈！這下他知道厲害了。來吧，走了。我們還有更重要的事要做，別在這兒閒晃。 "},
  {"id": 37, "src_sha256": "9cb3e86de3bc115d72604ef146ff548c59e7cc79456944680505e3dec3b1fe89", "zh": "看你以後還敢不敢惹我。 "},
  {"id": 38, "src_sha256": "ec6e5c8b7efd8e43caca04371762ae246b8eb9c33f851b14c5993125703a3e15", "zh": "那邊有人。 "},
  {"id": 39, "src_sha256": "419f66492172f1cbe1e2bdc5bc583caac722878af955106180072cc781e480ec", "zh": "沒子彈沒法射！ "},
  {"id": 40, "src_sha256": "67862fc97637e8a76eb1cfb5ff63126e9ccab66d339dbd7bd6ac2361dba1f635", "zh": "有人不見了。我們最好把他找回來。 "},
  {"id": 41, "src_sha256": "461a89f8407fc74aab841e268b7f16560679a56479e0193ff8fdf6050b1e41c3", "zh": "還等什麼鬼！就是這裡了……Cosmic Circle！ "},
  {"id": 42, "src_sha256": "a32a057d105551e942d49ac550fe28e07cb0533948f47765e79e003c4824cd3e", "zh": "所以現在輪到我們管宇宙了，是吧？好，讓我來！ "},
  {"id": 43, "src_sha256": "4b0e28b1a533b2c72479318c0aa9d6c9ee35b06cef1195416ec610ae5971077a", "zh": "我沒料到會這樣！不過……我還是會再做一次。 "},
  {"id": 44, "src_sha256": "58c0ae033107f9676c63c7e2c4d13ee9badabf3e02479a475537dcd010724b6f", "zh": "等等。等等。等一下！不對勁。感覺我每走一步，身上就被撕掉一塊。一定是 Al-Sedexus 和她的邪術。我想活命，就得回去跟她做個了斷。你們跟不跟？ "},
  {"id": 45, "src_sha256": "6e20ce916c5ac90189bba869177196748c86c81618b3de184bd2a70c6ec53d4c", "zh": "我們越來越近了。我感覺得到她……我當初是哪根筋不對，跟惡魔攪和在一起？ "},
  {"id": 46, "src_sha256": "2219d1295e4946d565229927b6206d45559a808a62a638d643fb1c56a245d1ee", "zh": "哎呀呀。Astral Dominae。我們的收藏多了一件好東西。 "},
  {"id": 47, "src_sha256": "10b5a35ddb64a42e038ae8c8c1c9df6dbfaf8fe9c8a25f056c364c6013dd9d6a", "zh": "Marten 花了好大工夫把這東西藏起來，是吧？一定有很多人想要，而且想得要命。 "},
  {"id": 48, "src_sha256": "a0789663e791d5a573a15376ee204efe4a7121af02710cbd547c339f4ebbd199", "zh": "太好了。我們拿到 Chaos 了。現在趕快離開這裡，免得 {{Mook}} 給我們的混亂比我們想要的還多。 "},
  {"id": 49, "src_sha256": "dd95b60ef12da8e533fe219b122dd3c4443152c8a87e9b24f9ebf54bfe299e3d", "zh": "Chaos！我還以為永遠拿不到這東西……而且我會確保再也沒有別人拿得到。 "},
  {"id": 50, "src_sha256": "5954d177f5b942b950e94a08cef8e1a5c480f2b767fc9be0b93bee3c1650f2e2", "zh": "所以 Rapax 和 Savant 是一夥的？坐在這裡嘴上說說也沒用。 "},
  {"id": 51, "src_sha256": "14abab36829b74f3630974bc0a06e79bb337f7cdf72ddced874d6a9bb865f232", "zh": "好啦，各位，是這樣的。我要在我的 {{Mook}} 同胞這座小堡壘裡待一陣子。別擔心，我會回來的。 "},
  {"id": 52, "src_sha256": "dd9198b9f30d47745cab582393e0ca3f2f6527209a4114f2c3067f5b2eefaec0", "zh": "我回來了。昨晚真夠嗆！我都忘了 {{Mook}} 的酒後勁這麼強……總之，有消息。我昨晚在裡面看到了東西。他們叫它 Callisto Device，但我覺得那是我們在找的玩意兒之一。 "},
  {"id": 53, "src_sha256": "f4db05c0bf7863dc083e671ffbc1fdbf2c4666b9b2c90ae1e51f4fd2c629416f", "zh": "不行。沒門。 "},
  {"id": 54, "src_sha256": "03ed7db44cfcd93cd64617c7dccebcdce77713648338e132ff68f6e2e459ba77", "zh": "一個字都別信。 "},
  {"id": 55, "src_sha256": "1bc0a016c4662db1adac4b067dfc8daee8f9f26023c6ef96579d246e6d69fa1f", "zh": "嗯，這個不錯。 "},
  {"id": 56, "src_sha256": "476ec3bf15e83dab96c2cb555890cf8cc05b39759bb7600e832c5092ed67ba9a", "zh": "下一個是誰？ "},
  {"id": 57, "src_sha256": "7686b3a6951288b599d112e609943ac902671f1b7da2dfc12d84feba9242d560", "zh": "是 Vi！ "},
  {"id": 58, "src_sha256": "8c0963653700efef7c70b7948b16cd6051736e05d62db3a95066fc6f42edcccb", "zh": "剛才真是千鈞一髮！ "},
  {"id": 59, "src_sha256": "9f414451c7b1ecf22e9386a43432bf579fa77e5013771a6290a9d64312429645", "zh": "Rapax。我討厭 Rapax。不過我也不意外，會跟 Rapax 聯手的只有 Dark Savant。 "},
  {"id": 60, "src_sha256": "1c3ee84a892abf09f0805b1da27f125103f626c13f0d49651a33cfa2ca6585c5", "zh": "我們去幹掉他——我不怕。不太怕。……好吧。也許我這回有點太過頭了。 "},
  {"id": 61, "src_sha256": "607816394842f95551c1c82f2e4861eeb74d031c617eca3408b6dd39dc4761ba", "zh": "我們最好跟那傢伙處好關係。也許他能幫我們弄到那支筆。再說——你們看到他的爪子了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 62, "src_sha256": "cf531000456347d41f5b1174d4f4e5e36ed88e19082706d0d433dd18e0bad69c", "zh": "看來 Savant 剛剛丟了回家的座駕。 "},
  {"id": 63, "src_sha256": "434cb4f1d55f1051063011ae1be0f7f871c926c3923517fc7e201661eb6083c4", "zh": "終於和平了。好啦，好啦。也許現在這些傢伙真的會幫我們一把。 "},
  {"id": 64, "src_sha256": "ce26c58921e9c1fe59fdd27acead9a80b108ae774ae52547a2fa76594210ce13", "zh": "喔喔。這不妙。殺死他們的東西搞不好還在附近。 "},
  {"id": 65, "src_sha256": "75dbe937e0d4c5f690da083ad47b4a22940750a9a2042a778fb84de79f74c6c7", "zh": "太好了。下一步是什麼？ "},
  {"id": 66, "src_sha256": "2cf0f983db3dfb58d36db1fe21b2e7ff76ab68ef8675791edb2997a0da35f8f7", "zh": "Dark Savant 會隨手把這東西扔掉嗎？才怪。我猜這東西是假的。 "},
  {"id": 67, "src_sha256": "9d2948ea1fdd1fad6bf4a61bce9d23306145d6543bd0bc4454c7d012eb5c4c18", "zh": "發現一隻生物。 "},
  {"id": 68, "src_sha256": "2d2f7d395bbe8920e1b244a870b46cd957a5d1afb9c2f27e88aa14d5c3d17bd3", "zh": "看到一群什麼東西…… "},
  {"id": 84, "src_sha256": "fa279a84062af3101af311de24a0d333a9142aa600b6430b1d6ec0a25ed48bc5", "zh": "嗯，這才像話。 "},
  {"id": 85, "src_sha256": "0a09897e7c83aa0dbc0d55a6c921796717bc1264dd89059c075ff705f3c07d85", "zh": "好，這樣好多了。 "},
  {"id": 120, "src_sha256": "845ff3c9516f918edecccf66252f83be5e03d7724af7fa18d33f6b37a6891559", "zh": "你們聽到那傢伙說的了。出發吧！ "},
  {"id": 123, "src_sha256": "dbc5da56ce55a07be11f9b321a8f48ab1a58672e32e93c17455f228542d89f5b", "zh": "我還以為他永遠說不完。他是怎樣，自己把自己悶死了？ "},
  {"id": 124, "src_sha256": "f22e29f4077eb6902d75b57173a12b8297ff11bc621dbe90c9f0597a414f3006", "zh": "Cosmic Lords 的信使——想想看！ "},
  {"id": 129, "src_sha256": "f13a47ae584474c7cb025d1c14b104c6fb6ea883a988b76fd5331c25af5e88e6", "zh": "好啦各位，像白痴一樣站在這裡不會讓我們回家。第一件事就是四處{{Scouting}}，弄清楚我們在哪。 "},
  {"id": 130, "src_sha256": "19fce0993b8f112e6b77ff4fc5a2ee2911f12e95136002ab9ff9293e472696a2", "zh": "你覺得這玩意兒是幹嘛的？ "},
  {"id": 131, "src_sha256": "70abd5f1e44f41ec549a7475fccf2f6f3066d3fe33ff53d377f0f5967871f4ba", "zh": "啊啊。終於把那個聲音趕出我腦袋了。這下我學到一夜情的教訓了，是吧？ "},
  {"id": 132, "src_sha256": "ecedf45c028596ff643a75b52141e6044c629aacc137676e4cb62da80f78b901", "zh": "好，任務完成。也許我們可以用這個 Helm，從 Marten 那裡換到 Destinae Dominus。 "},
  {"id": 136, "src_sha256": "d8d6f851c1463ae71d74444c982153a2b4e62cc25052cacc560b287a86b09adf", "zh": "沒錯，搞定了。Arnika 的市民今晚可以安心睡覺了。現在離開這座塔吧。這地方讓我毛骨悚然！ "},
  {"id": 141, "src_sha256": "119bf6ebbf15dbc5d580a5d9ed686e9f05780c9fd43175f6d526ea8bbe411c43", "zh": "好了，大家準備好跳下去了嗎？我們要在下面待上很長一段時間。 "},
  {"id": 145, "src_sha256": "c81fa69d089d639e6bb266574baef73bf583334798a0fcee7e574cedbfbeee94", "zh": "嘖，先是跟這些傢伙打，現在還要加入他們的社團。天啊，還能再怪一點嗎？ "}
]
